(% class="legend-box" %)
**Legend:** (% style="color:#f1c40f" %)🏆 Best-in-slot(%%) · (% style="color:#7fdbff" %)⭐ Strong endgame(%%) · (% style="color:#b39ddb" %)🟣 Rare/Ex(%%) · (% style="color:#fff176" %)🟡 Rare(%%) · Links go to **bg-wiki.com**.

(% class="legend-box" %)
**Tank focus.** Leveling = damage/Acc/Enmity to hold hate. Endgame = **Enmity+, HP+, damage taken-%**. PLD/NIN swaps sword skill / VIT for Haste / -Enmity / Fast Cast.

{{toc/}}

----

= Trust Recommendations =

You tank — Cure/Protect/Shell/Flash/Sentinel/Cover. You're MP-hungry and do low damage. Need: Haste, Refresh, DPS.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Arciela">Arciela</a></strong></td><td>Only healer with Haste AND Refresh gambits — exactly what PLD needs</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Monberaux">Monberaux</a></strong></td><td>Guard Drink (Pro+Shell stack), Regen, STR boost, Ether at <50% MP, wide status removal</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>March/Madrigal speed up kills, Ballad helps your MP, Elegy on mob</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Zeid_II">Zeid II</a></strong></td><td>Stun on casting/readying protects you, Last Resort/Souleater for damage</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Ayame">Ayame</a></strong></td><td>Hasso/Third Eye/Meditate — fully self-sufficient DPS, no support overlap</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

