= 🛡️ PLD/NIN Loadout =

(% class="legend-box" %)
**Situational** — for fights that hit too hard to face-tank (Wyrms, Cerberus). Stack **Haste + Enmity + HP** to keep Utsusemi/Flash spam-ready. Drop Shield Skill / VIT.

